        <oboInOwl:id>CL:0000710</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:comment>The term &quot;neuroepithelial cell&quot; is used to describe both this cell type and sensory epithelial cell (CL:0000098).</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>neurecto-epithelial cell</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


