        <obo:IAO_0000115>A hydrographic feature characterized by the dominance of snow or ice.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>EcoLexicon:ice</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>FTT:648</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>SWEETRealm:LandIce</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>TGN:21410</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasNarrowSynonym>glacer</oboInOwl:hasNarrowSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Ice</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>LandIce</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>glacial landform</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>glacier feature</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset>envoPolar</oboInOwl:inSubset>
        <rdfs:comment>Likely to be depopulated and &quot;glacial&quot; made into a quality or similar.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>glacial feature</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    <owl:Axiom>
