        <owl:annotatedTarget>A portion of brick material is a material derived from a brick which is composed of  kneaded clay-bearing soil, expanded clay aggregate, sand and lime, or concrete that has been fire-hardened or air-dried.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brick</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
