        <obo:IAO_0000115>A planned environmental usage process during which an environment supports welfare activities organised by the state or a local authority and carried out by trained personnel.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:created_by rdf:resource="http://orcid.org/0000-0002-4366-3088"/>
        <rdfs:comment>Services include those provided by health care facilities, places of religious worship, educational facilities, police stations, fire stations, coastguard facilities, public sanitation, non-human animal welfare services, detention services, and other public services.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">usage of an environment for community and social services</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
