        <obo:IAO_0000115>A region of a chromosome at which a DNA double-strand break has occurred. DNA damage signaling and repair proteins accumulate at the lesion to respond to the damage and repair the DNA to form a continuous DNA helix.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:created_by>bf</oboInOwl:created_by>
        <oboInOwl:creation_date>2011-05-17T03:04:42Z</oboInOwl:creation_date>
