        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Isotopes that exhibit radioactivity and undergo radioactive decay. (From Grant &amp; Hackh&apos;s Chemical Dictionary, 5th ed &amp; McGraw-Hill Dictionary of Scientific and Technical Terms, 4th ed)</obo:IAO_0000115>
