        <obo:IAO_0000115>Any vertebral bone that is part of the caudal region of the vertebral column (tail or coccyx).</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000001>Vertebrae bearing a hemal arch and spine. The most posterior caudal vertebrae support the caudal fin and are referred to as preural vertebrae.[TAO]</obo:UBPROP_0000001>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000012>we deliberately merge the MA classes as we believe them equivalent</obo:UBPROP_0000012>
