        <obo:IAO_0000115>Epithelial layer that lines the intestine.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000001>Simple columnar epithelium that lines the intestine, sometimes pseudostratified, with absorptive brush-border cells and mucous goblet cells clearly visible. Crosnier et al. 2005[TAO]</obo:UBPROP_0000001>
