        <obo:IAO_0000115>A layer of epithelial cells that is part of the eye.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000232>this class is the superclass of the anterior epithelium and equatorial epithlium, although the term &apos;lens epithelium&apos; may refer specifically to the former</obo:IAO_0000232>
        <obo:RO_0002175 rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_9606"/>
