        <owl:annotatedTarget>Together, our results reveal a shared basic organization in the tegmental domains of the diencephalon and midbrain of developing lamprey, indicating early appearance of the domain in vertebrate phylogeny.[well established][VHOG]</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:date_retrieved rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2012-09-17</oboInOwl:date_retrieved>
