        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A distinct juvenile form many animals undergo before metamorphosis into adults. Animals with indirect development such as insects, amphibians, or cnidarians typically have a larval phase of their life cycle.</obo:IAO_0000115>
