        <rdfs:comment>&quot;An electric current unit which is equal to the constant current which, if maintained in two straight parallel conductors of infinite length, of negligible circular cross-section, and placed 1 m apart in vacuum, would produce between these conductors a force equal to 2 x 10^[-7] newton per meter of length.&quot; [BIPM:BIPM, NIST:NIST]</rdfs:comment>
